    "finch always keeps your latest backup on this device. Open Backups to add a folder history (count, frequency), browse backups, and restore an earlier version.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "finch 始终在本设备保留最新备份。打开“备份”可添加文件夹历史（数量、频率）、浏览备份并恢复较早版本。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "finch is locked": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "finch 已锁定"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "finch keeps its latest backup on this device, refreshed at most once a day — a quick, offline restore point. “Back up now” always writes a fresh one. Turn on a backup folder to keep a browsable history off-device.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "finch 在本设备保留最新备份，每天至多刷新一次——一个快速的离线恢复点。“立即备份”总是写入新备份。开启备份文件夹可在设备之外保留可浏览的历史。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
